  "limits": "2D only, with the view cone measured from a facing vector. Occlusion is whatever the Callable reports, such as a physics ray; nothing is cast by default. Hearing ignores walls. Target ids are StringNames. Verified with Godot 4.7.2 headless; written against the Godot 4.3 API.",
